LeLab Puls community enhancements
Copyright 2026 LeLab Puls contributors

This distribution includes modified source from Hugging Face LeLab:
https://github.com/huggingface/leLab
Upstream baseline: 9b5afaee33baa1d773e499937564f3831d25de22
Copyright notices in upstream files are preserved.

Community modifications include configurable caches, LeRobot v0.7.0
compatibility, training configuration import/editing, browser-controlled
native inference, supported guided RTC selection, camera identity/preview
handling, fault/stop feedback, and the optional PI05 FP8 deployment extension.
See CHANGELOG.md for this distribution's modification summary.

LeRobot is an external dependency, not a vendored source tree:
https://github.com/huggingface/lerobot

Bundled frontend assets, including the upstream SO-101 URDF and mesh files,
retain their accompanying source and license notices. Dependencies, model
weights and datasets are subject to their respective licenses.
